  "source_review": {
    "basis": "Independently read Wilson et al2015 relevant text and Figure6 caption and personally viewed the stored Figure6 pixels plus Alberta original stem and pinnule-section pixels.6A is an erect compression-fossil-derived reconstruction,6B another habit. Compound fronds and sparse persistent bases supported, complete precise crown is interpretation.",
