      "https://authors.library.caltech.edu/records/zp4af-bsq02"
    ],
    "limits": "The2011 Caltech record was inaccessible in this fresh web read, so no new independent claim to reading it.2015 explicit growth-form diversity supports the limitation: the chosen erect form is not universal to Medullosa. Figure6 is a published reconstruction, not raw whole-plant fossil pixels."
