  "visual_review": {
    "observations": "All eight exact final frames personally viewed. Six broad-spread, multi-order fans retain separate petiole/fan/pinna/pinnule hierarchy. Sparse persistent stem stubs replace continuous armor. The r002 main-stem frame-flip wedges are absent in exact r003 front/reverse/side/clay images. Crown is deliberately sparse with much open scaffold, not a photographic reconstruction of the dense source illustration; no additional hard density requirement was invented.",
